{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"tool_call","status":"complete","toolCallId":"01a15347-1d5d-756c-9162-717fd424b4ad","toolName":"task","args":{},"result":"{\"lg_name\":\"Command\",\"update\":{\"files\":{},\"messages\":[{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",\"id\":[\"langchain_core\",\"messages\",\"ToolMessage\"],\"kwargs\":{\"content\":\"## Source\\n/home/user/app/contracts/DealFactory.sol  \\n/home/user/app/contracts/DemandPool.sol  \\n/home/user/app/contracts/Settler.sol\\n\\n## Action\\nextended\\n\\n## Survey\\n- `survey_solidity_contracts` candidates:\\n  - `contracts/DealFactory.sol` (declares `DealFactory`)\\n  - `contracts/DemandPool.sol` (declares `DemandPool`)\\n  - `contracts/Settler.sol` (declares `Settler`)\\n  - `contracts/SwarmTypes.sol` (declares `SwarmTypes`)\\n- `survey_solidity_contracts` hidden: none (`hiddenCount = 0`).\\n- Worked on:\\n  - `/home/user/app/contracts/DealFactory.sol`\\n  - `/home/user/app/contracts/DemandPool.sol`\\n  - `/home/user/app/contracts/Settler.sol`\\n- Parent also named `/home/user/app/contracts/SwarmTypes.sol`; it was surveyed and read, and left unchanged per instruction.\\n\\n## Summary\\n- Applied Finding 1 in `Settler.settle()` with surgical logic changes only:\\n  - replaced direct `paid - cp` accounting with:\\n    - `settledPrice = paid < cp ? paid : cp`\\n    - `refund = paid - settledPrice`\\n    - per-buyer supplier contribution from `settledPrice`\\n  - changed supplier credit accumulation from `cp * buyerCount` to `sum(settledPrice)`.\\n  - updated invariant assertion to `assert(totalRefunds + totalSupplierCredit == totalEscrowed)`.\\n  - kept `Settled` event parameter as nominal `cp` while using `settledPrice` for accounting.\\n- Applied Finding 2 access-control event coverage:\\n  - `DealFactory`: added and emitted `OwnershipTransferred`, `PausedContract`, `UnpausedContract`, `DemandPoolSet`, `SettlerSet` in the specified functions.\\n  - `DemandPool`: added `OwnershipTransferred`, `SettlerSet`; emitted in `setSettler`; added `transferOwnership(address)` with event emission.\\n  - `Settler`: added `OwnershipTransferred`; emitted in `transferOwnership`.\\n- Applied Finding 3 in `Settler`:\\n  - removed `paused` state variable.\\n  - removed `pause()` and `unpause()` functions.\\n  - removed unused `Paused` error.\\n  - preserved `owner`, `onlyOwner`, and `transferOwnership` as requested.\\n- Deliberately left all other logic/signatures untouched, and did not modify `SwarmTypes.sol`.\",\"tool_call_id\":\"toolu_bdrk_01TZURfJ1PRws6JT65fzhDAr\",\"name\":\"task\",\"additional_kwargs\":{},\"response_metadata\":{}}}]},\"goto\":[]}"}}
